Add the comma that the previous last field now needs. delete_task's one-line `{ taskId: string }` becomes `{ taskId: string, workerId?: string }` with its comment, or a two-field block. Touch nothing else in those sections; update_epic's status-enum drift is out of scope. Edit docs/MCP_SERVER.md with the session's own editing tool: Edit on a Claude seat, apply_patch on a codex exec seat, never Serena (it ignores docs/) and never a shell write.
